{"id":252507541103972,"type":"artist","name":"The Ventures","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":65,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Ventures.png?width=500","bio":"The Ventures se formaron en el año 1959 en Tacoma, Estado de Washington y originalmente su nombre era The Versations. Su formación inicial la componían: Don Wilson, (segunda guitarra); Bob Bobgle, (guitarra líder); Nokie Edwards, (bajo) y Howie Johnson en los tambores, quien luego sería sustituido por Mel Taylor en 1963. Wilson y Bobgle posteriormente cambiaron sus puestos en guitarra. Su primer gran éxito fue «Walk don’t run» (Camina, no corras) en 1960, al cual le hicieron luego otras versiones mejoradas.","tags":["Surf","surf rock","instrumental","60s","rock"]},"works":[{"id":27893299383198,"type":"album","name":"Walk Don't Run","artist":"The Ventures","year":1960,"weight":13,"yt":"CFbSKlzCfqE","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":161529817301205,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Rock","rank":34,"scaruffi":null},{"id":167213801476273,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Music","rank":51,"scaruffi":null},{"id":240735758437916,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Rock & Roll","rank":126,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":238293001195481,"type":"song","name":"Walk, Don't Run","artist":"The Ventures","year":1960,"weight":4,"yt":"hIuIIqbyEIU","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":132782249584307,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1960","rank":25,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":25,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":242261057656212,"type":"album","name":"Another Smash!!!","artist":"The Ventures","year":1961,"weight":3,"yt":"3bhQr7K2K5o","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":161529817301205,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Rock","rank":85,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":322041